<h2><strong><span style="font-size: 20px; color: #000000;">Bybit Historical Data API</span></strong></h2>
<p><span style="color: #1a1d28;">Historical data is a necessity for serious traders. You can use our Bybit historical data to backtest strategies as well as help determine strategic entry and exit points. We offer Bybit historical data that's timestamped, tick-by-tick trade data, beginning on </span><span style="font-size: 11px; color: #444746;">2021-09-01</span><span style="color: #1a1d28;"> This data is available via </span><a href="https://docs.amberdata.io/reference/defi-overview"><span>REST API</span></a><span style="color: #1155cc;">,</span><span style="color: #1a1d28;"> with bulk historical data downloads available via </span><a href="https://docs.amberdata.io/docs/s3-bulk-downloads"><span>AWS S3</span></a><span style="color: #1a1d28;">. Our datasets are normalized and standardized for quality, reliability, and ease of use</span></p>
